// 开源广场光碟架展开以后右边那一栏的内容：试玩窗口、拆开看（代码里的机关 / 部件图 / 输入 → 输出 / 装前装后）、教学路线、碟的资料表。
// 版式沿用发现页光碟架的详细介绍（dg-d-sec、dg-d-table、细线），见 disc-rack.css。数据见 public/data/albums.json。
// 没核对的一律标“待核对”；没跑过的对照只写计划，不写结果。
import { esc } from './data.js';
import { albumPlayable, albumURLSafe } from './album-schema.js';

export const MODULES = {
  tools: { name: '工具箱', lead: '电脑整理、网络采集和 Linux 起步：先试，再学，带回自己的工具包' },
  project: { name: '项目', lead: '能看见、能试的作品，按主题编成专辑' },
  ai: { name: 'AI 强化', lead: '同一个任务，附加规则前后，用真实运行记录说话' },
  learn: { name: '教育', lead: '简单直观的作品和学习路线：能直接玩、能拆开看，再一站站学' },
};
export const KIND = { live: '能直接玩', recording: '录屏', author: '作者演示', student: '同学做的', explainer: '图解' };
export const CHECK = { 'site-code': '本站代码', verified: '已核对', unverified: '待核对' };

const https = u => albumURLSafe(u, {local:false}) ? u : null;
const local = u => typeof u === 'string' && !u.startsWith('https://') && albumURLSafe(u) ? u : null;

export function indexData(data) {
  const albums = new Map(data.albums.map((a) => [a.id, a]));
  const discs = new Map(data.discs.map((d) => [d.id, d]));
  const albumOf = (id) => data.albums.find((a) => a.discs.includes(id));
  return { albums, discs, albumOf, today: data.today || { picks: [] }, list: data.albums };
}

/** 专辑库里打开某张专辑（某一首、某个模式）的地址 */
export const albumLink = (album, disc, mode) =>
  `albums.html?m=${album.module}&a=${encodeURIComponent(album.id)}${disc ? `&d=${encodeURIComponent(disc.id)}` : ''}${mode ? `&mode=${mode}` : ''}`;

/** 进精选的门槛：真有能播或能玩的东西（前端也卡一道，不只靠编辑） */
export const playable = albumPlayable;

/** 这张碟能怎么看 */
export function modesOf(disc) {
  if (disc.view === 'path') return [{ id: 'learn', label: '路线' }];
  const x = disc.experience || {}, modes = [];
  if (playable(disc)) modes.push({ id: 'watch', label: '看效果' });
  if (x.tool || x.demo || x.story || local(x.play)) modes.push({ id: 'try', label: '试一试' });
  if (disc.inside?.length || ['anatomy', 'io', 'compare'].includes(disc.view)) modes.push({ id: 'inside', label: '拆开看' });
  if (disc.learn) modes.push({ id: 'learn', label: '去学' });
  return modes;
}

export function licenseShort(disc) {
  const l = disc.upstreams?.[0]?.license || '';
  if (/授权/.test(l)) return '作者授权';
  return /^[\w.\- ]{2,24}$/.test(l) ? l : '待核对';
}

/* ---------------- 试玩窗口 ---------------- */

/** 看效果 / 试一试：站内试玩（iframe）、本站的动效试玩（页面挂上）、作者的动图或视频 */
export function screenHTML(disc, { watch = false, autoplay = watch } = {}) {
  const x = disc.experience || {};
  if (x.tool) return `<div data-tool-demo="${esc(x.tool)}"></div>`;
  if (x.story === 'skill-compare') return '<div class="pz-story-window" data-story="skill-compare"></div>';
  const m = x.media || {}, src = local(m.src) || https(m.src);
  const play = local(x.play);
  let body, credit = '';
  if (play && !(watch && src)) {
    body = `<iframe class="pz-frame" src="${esc(play)}${watch && autoplay ? '?demo=1' : ''}" title="${esc(disc.title)}${watch ? '（自动演示）' : '（试玩）'}"${x.isolate ? ' sandbox="allow-scripts"' : ''}${watch ? ' tabindex="-1"' : ''} loading="lazy"></iframe>`;
  } else if (x.demo && !(watch && src)) {
    body = `<div class="pz-live" data-demo="${esc(x.demo)}"></div>`;
  } else if (src) {
    const poster = local(m.poster) || https(m.poster);
    body = ['mp4','webm'].includes(m.type)
      ? `<video class="pz-media" src="${esc(src)}"${poster ? ` poster="${esc(poster)}"` : ''} muted loop playsinline controls${autoplay ? ' autoplay' : ''} preload="metadata"></video>`
      : `<img class="pz-media" src="${esc(src)}" alt="${esc(disc.title)}的演示动图" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">`;
    const link = https(m.url);
    credit = `<p class="cite pz-credit">${link ? `<a href="${esc(link)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(m.credit || '来源')}</a>` : esc(m.credit || '')}</p>`;
  } else body = '<p class="pz-none">还没有能播的东西，等录屏或作者演示</p>';
  const phone = x.phone === 'square' ? ' data-phone="square"' : '';
  return `<div class="pz-window${x.demo && !watch ? ' is-tall' : ''}"${phone}>${body}</div>${credit}`;
}

/* ---------------- 拆开看 ---------------- */

export function insideHTML(disc) {
  if (disc.view === 'anatomy') return anatomyHTML(disc);
  if (disc.view === 'io') return ioHTML(disc);
  if (disc.view === 'compare') return compareHTML(disc);
  return (disc.inside || []).map((it, i) => {
    const href = local(it.url) || https(it.url);
    const where = href ? `<a href="${esc(href)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(it.where)}</a>` : esc(it.where);
    return `<section class="dg-d-sec dg-d-block"><h3><span class="num pz-n">${String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>${esc(it.title)}</h3><p>${esc(it.detail)}</p><p class="cite">在 ${where}</p></section>`;
  }).join('');
}

